 mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학부과목과 대학원과목을 합하여 학생의 학기당 수강신청 최대 학점 이내</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"-ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">초과학기자 및 학</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림;\">․</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">석사연계과정은 학기당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">학점 신청 가능</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -33.7pt; margin-left: 33.7pt; -ms-layout-grid-mode: both; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림;\">   </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-rais